# 大きな図形 (docs/private/fixed-buffer-audit.md 10), for tools/ui_run.py:
# a figure of 10000 rectangles and two lines of 2000 points each (more than
# the 256 shapes and 1024 points a shape the figure editor took before),
# made as a copy of 画用紙 (mkbig) and opened; everything picked and moved
# to the tray (トレーへ移動) and back (トレーから移動), the tray holding
# all of it; the figure saved by closing, opened again and found whole.
# The times are printed ("time ...").
# Keys: A 04, X 1B, Z 1D, E 08 with Ctrl (01).
# the desktop's figure editor opened by open, whatever the program object says (figproc kernel)
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 10000 2000
mark
open big
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
under open 30000
shot big_fig_open
shapes
want ok 10002 0
mark
key 04 01
sync 600
under pickall 10000
shapes
want ok 10002 10002
mark
key 1B 01
sync 600
under cut 30000
shapes
want ok 0 0
mark
key 1D 01
sync 600
under moveback 60000
shapes
want ok 10002 10002
shot big_fig_back
mark
key 08 01
sync 600
under closed 30000
sum
keep saved
mark
open big
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
under reopen 30000
shapes
want ok 10002 0
key 08 01
sync 600
sum
same saved
absent !OACV!
